// Everglade's mounts (everglade/docs/mounts-spec.md): the game layer every Everglade zone shares, on
// the Metaverse Engine's mounts (aethyr/action/mount.coax, the mount, its gaits, steering, mounting and riding
// collision; aethyr/action/ride-pose.coax, the rider's seat). This module owns what makes them
// Everglade's: the SRD's Riding Horse handling, the white horse's baked frames in a zone's pack
// (glade/horse0..35: Idle, Walk, Gallop, twelve frames each; verse/tools/assets/horse_pack.coax) and
// its saddle points, E to mount and dismount, the prompts, the phone's button, the stick's steering,
// and where the rider sits. A zone places its horses (eg_mount_add), hands this the boxes its walker
// collides with, and draws what it returns. Nothing here knows a zone.
//
// The red dragon is the same kind of mount with wings (eg_dragon_add): its frames are the pack's
// glade/dragon0..74 (everglade/dragon-clips.coax), its saddle the model's `saddle` bone at the base of
// the neck, and it flies on the Metaverse Engine's shared winged flight (aethyr/action/flight.coax) at the SRD Adult
// Red Dragon's speeds: Speed 40 ft, Fly 80 ft. Space takes off, beats and climbs, Shift dives, X lands;
// nobody gets off in the air ("Land first").
//
// Mounting and getting off are deeds (aethyr/action/deed.coax, docs/verse/action-pipeline.md): each
// declares its feel (eg_mount_feel), a press asks with your bearing (your SRD conditions: nobody
// mounts unconscious, paralyzed or grappled), the mount rules act, and only a yes presents (show).
//   coax/bin/coax test everglade/mounts.coax --library
#module "everglade.mounts";
#load "../aethyr/action/mount.coax";
#load "shared/mount-kinds.coax";   // the kinds' handling and a rider's keys, the room's too (#13268)
#load "../aethyr/action/deed.coax";
#load "../aethyr/fx/puff.coax";
#load "dragon-clips.coax";

EG_MOUNTS :: 4;            // horses a zone places at most
EG_HORSE_FRAMES :: 36;
EG_HORSE_CLIP :: 12;       // frames a clip
// The SRD's Riding Horse (shared/mount-kinds.coax).
EG_RIDING_HORSE :: MK_RIDING_HORSE;
